<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>KMed | Dashboard</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/components/sidebar.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/app/dashboard.css" />
</head>
<body class="page-bg">

  <%- include("../partials/sidebar", { active: "dashboard", userNome: nome }) %>

  <main class="with-sidebar">
    <div class="page">
      <h1>Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="sub">Bem-vindo, <strong><%= nome %></strong></p>

      <div class="card">
        <p>Login pronto. Agora dá pra ir em <strong>Matérias / Tópicos</strong> e depois <strong>Registrar o Dia</strong>.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="/conteudos">Cadastrar matérias</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/registrar">Registrar o dia</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
